OL,3,ABurnham says he was not aware of
OL,4,ABrand's 'horrific' crimes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has said
OL,7,FRussell Brand has rightly been held to
OL,8,Faccount for his "horrific" crimes and
OL,9,Fsought to explain Labour's previous
OL,10,Fassociation with the comedian.
OL,12,FBrand was found guilty of one count of
OL,13,Frape and three counts of sexual assault
OL,14,Fon Thursday.
OL,16,FSome within the Labour Party attempted
OL,17,Fto court Brand's support more than a
OL,18,Fdecade ago, before police began
OL,19,Finvestigating him.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
