OL,3,ABurnham says he was not aware of
OL,4,ABrand's 'horrific' crimes
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on Friday, Burnham said: "It's
OL,7,Fnot always the case that people know
OL,8,Feverything about people in public
OL,9,Flife."
